### 1. Register a new user (If server restarted)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Matin",
    "email": "matin@example.com",
    "password": "12345678",
    "role": "member"
}

### 2. Login to get the JWT token
POST http://localhost:9090/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "matin@example.com",
    "password": "12345678"
}

### 3. Test Protected Route WITHOUT token (Should give 401)
GET http://localhost:9090/api/me/profile

### 4. Test Protected Route WITH token (Should give 200)
GET http://localhost:9090/api/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJleHAiOjE3ODkzOTY5MTUsInJvbGUiOiJtZW1iZXIiLCJ1c2VyX2lkIjowfQ.A-EmIruaitM8SqcwDe_PfreyBDH_-4YPKUbGoTKDn6k